#: ../../reference/cli.rst:4
msgid "Command-line reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:6
msgid ""
"``anet`` is the node program: it starts the daemon, manages identities, "
"sends and receives tasks, sets limits and reads the local evidence chain."
" ``anet-hub`` and ``anet-hub-admin`` are the programs of a hub operator. "
"This page lists the commands of all three, the conventions that they "
"share and the commands that 0.3 removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference/cli.rst:18
msgid "Conventions"
msgstr ""

